~ well_keeper

if GameState.has_flag("met_odo")
	Odo: Back again. The well's still sweet, the fields are still wrong.
	if GameState.has_flag("heard_about_fields")
		Odo: You said you'd look at the eastern fields. Words are wind, wayfarer.
	else
		- Ask about the fields
			Odo: Three weeks now. The water in the east paddies went bad overnight — crops black by morning.
			Odo: Something came through that tear. Nobody's been out there since.
			do GameState.set_flag("heard_about_fields")
		- Just passing through
			Odo: Mm. Keep your sword loose all the same.
else
	Odo: New face. We don't get many since the eastern fields went bad.
	Odo: I'm Odo. I keep the well. Only honest work left around here.
	do GameState.set_flag("met_odo")
	- Who's the armed man by the road?
		Odo: Trouble. Been eyeing the hay cart all morning. Were I you, I'd deal with him before he deals with you.
	- What happened to the fields?
		Odo: Three weeks now. The water in the east paddies went bad overnight — crops black by morning.
		Odo: Something came through that tear. Nobody's been out there since.
		do GameState.set_flag("heard_about_fields")

=> END
